  m_text: '1.  Each round shows a tricky picture puzzle.


    2.  Switch the chat
    to <b>GUESS</b> mode and type the word or phrase the picture represents.


    3. 
    Normal <b>CHAT</b> messages never score points.


    4.  Faster correct guesses
    earn more points: 100 / 80 / 60 / 40 / 20.


    5.  Each round lasts 30 seconds.
    After all rounds, the highest total score wins!'
